stateDiagram-v2
    state "UPLOADING (browser đang PUT part lên R2)" as UPLOADING
    state "UPLOADED (CompleteMultipartUpload xong trên R2)" as UPLOADED
    state "PROCESSING (đã báo Mux pull, chờ webhook ready)" as PROCESSING
    state "READY (phát được, muxPlaybackId đã set, reviewState = AWAITING_REVIEW)" as READY
    state "FAILED (terminal — errorMessage ghi lý do, không bao giờ quay lại)" as FAILED

    [*] --> UPLOADING : initiate multipart (upload route, default của schema)

    UPLOADING --> UPLOADED : finalize R2 thành công (complete route)
    UPLOADING --> FAILED : janitor sweep (a) expireInflightUpload — session quá 24h, abort R2

    UPLOADED --> READY : driveCompletion — IMAGE nhảy thẳng READY + head flip
    UPLOADED --> PROCESSING : driveCompletion — VIDEO + send review/upload.completed
    UPLOADED --> FAILED : applyMuxErrored (webhook errored đến khi còn UPLOADED)

    PROCESSING --> READY : applyMuxReady — webhook video.asset.ready hoặc janitor reconcile (atomic flip, idempotent)
    PROCESSING --> FAILED : applyMuxErrored — video.asset.errored / magic-bytes không phải video / Mux 404 / kẹt quá 24h

    READY --> [*] : purgeExpiredTrash — trash quá 30 ngày, xóa Mux + R2 + DB
    FAILED --> [*] : purgeExpiredTrash / xóa version

    note right of PROCESSING
        Janitor sweep (c) đối chiếu Mux khi kẹt quá 20 phút.
        Chưa có muxAssetId thì re-send review/upload.completed.
        Quá 24h vẫn preparing thì FAILED + deleteMuxAsset.
    end note

    note right of READY
        Khi READY còn chạy thêm (inngest.ts 99-190):
        clear statusId approved trên ReviewAsset,
        currentVersionId = version mới,
        revokeClientExposureOnNewVersion,
        syncTaskFromReviewEvent sang REVIEW_STATUS_MAP.submitted,
        notify uploader + manager.
        ReviewState là mấy trạng thái RIÊNG:
        DRAFT / AWAITING_REVIEW / CHANGES_REQUESTED / APPROVED.
    end note

